      "title": "Validate retained opening setup scope and quarantine affected dependents",
      "spec": "#132 common envelope: reconcile copied data by counts and deterministic hashes; approved #153 positive classification, as recorded in inactive-expansion/verification.md: Every remaining row must positively match Accounts and matching referenced company/year/obligation.",
      "description": "Non-null preview/submission setup_id never participates in classification. Existing legacy FK permits a valid setup ID from a different company/year; existing sibling barriers also allow it. The independent exact-migration probe copied cross-company/wrong-year preview rows and a cross-company submission with zero quarantine while all reconciliations passed. Preserve matching/null references, quarantine missing/mismatched source-owned setups and propagate preview quarantine to dependent copies.",
